sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W1 as Worker 1
    participant DB as PostgreSQL DB
    participant W2 as Worker 2

    W1->>DB: BEGIN & SELECT FOR UPDATE (Locks row)
    W2->>DB: BEGIN & SELECT FOR UPDATE (Blocks)
    W1->>DB: UPDATE payments & COMMIT (Releases lock)
    DB-->>W2: Unblocks W2 (Reads updated state & aborts duplicate)
